       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-CLAY-OS-PIPELINE.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-CLAY-OS-PROOFS.
           05  WS-6STEP-DISPATCH-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-FCB-RECORD-LOCK-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TPA-SWIGLU-INGEST-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-WMQ-VECTOR-LINES-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CLAY-OS-SEAL-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-CLAY-OS-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-CLAY-OS-PROVEN       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-CLAY-OS-CODE       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-DISPATCH-AND-LOCKS.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-TPA-AND-WMQ.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-CLAY-OS-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-DISPATCH-AND-LOCKS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-6STEP-DISPATCH-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-FCB-RECORD-LOCK-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-TPA-AND-WMQ.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TPA-SWIGLU-INGEST-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-WMQ-VECTOR-LINES-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-CLAY-OS-PROOFS.
           IF WS-6STEP-DISPATCH-OK = 1 AND
              WS-FCB-RECORD-LOCK-OK = 1 AND
              WS-TPA-SWIGLU-INGEST-OK = 1 AND
              WS-WMQ-VECTOR-LINES-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-CLAY-OS-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-CLAY-OS-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-CLAY-OS-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-CLAY-OS-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-CLAY-OS-CODE.
